{
  "content": {
    "arguments": "$ARGUMENTS",
    "constraints": [
      {
        "id": "b585c3bb-04fe-48d4-9630-a9c6b7e58685",
        "text": "Use the Bash tool. The Pebbles CLI at \"{PEBBLES_CLI}\" is the ONLY sanctioned way to change spec files — never edit .pebble files directly."
      },
      {
        "id": "6b4b6b12-fbf4-48fc-8614-f8950445849f",
        "text": "Bound by system rule: Spec mutation contract (rules/system/spec-mutation-contract)"
      },
      {
        "id": "c703b41b-5e4f-4fb5-81a0-7d049b88c44d",
        "text": "Bound by system rule: Table completeness (rules/system/table-completeness)"
      },
      {
        "id": "9a488cf3-7c57-4b85-9725-f721f53caf6e",
        "text": "Bound by system rule: Reference integrity (rules/system/reference-integrity)"
      },
      {
        "id": "6075880a-289b-4dd5-ad06-8318fd6c0548",
        "text": "Bound by system rule: Status discipline (rules/system/status-discipline)"
      },
      {
        "id": "bc7f0c24-e29f-4237-8d8a-0dedbc3e522a",
        "text": "Bound by system rule: Extraction — completeness standard (rules/system/extraction-standard)"
      }
    ],
    "examples": [],
    "kind": "skill",
    "onFailure": [
      {
        "id": "c397b839-8f85-4077-8567-f06b9ac6db9d",
        "text": "Read the CLI error — it names the fix; correct the call and retry once"
      },
      {
        "id": "77d0e25f-9049-4738-be4b-c29ee7acc2d4",
        "text": "NEVER fall back to editing .pebble files directly, whatever failed"
      },
      {
        "id": "5ecd5ab5-2ab1-4874-8f74-9f5b1e07a237",
        "text": "If still blocked, report the exact command and error to the user and stop"
      }
    ],
    "output": "The diff between spec and code, and the side that changed — never a direct .pebble edit.",
    "prerequisites": [
      {
        "id": "c84182b7-763a-4fad-b93d-e29e8e3c2e0c",
        "text": "A saved map — find the model file via the graph"
      },
      {
        "id": "31463316-e45d-4f86-aa75-5591e7be02be",
        "text": "The DIRECTION is chosen: code→spec or spec→code (confirm if ambiguous)"
      }
    ],
    "purpose": "Fill a model pebble from the real code (or vice-versa)",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "87b4239c-394e-4ef2-9ee3-ec9399d686b1",
        "text": "Reconcile a model/table pebble with the real code, in the direction the user needs: $ARGUMENTS"
      },
      {
        "id": "2db685ab-d5f2-455c-9204-94ff9a52e446",
        "text": "SCOPE FIRST (echo): which model pebble, and WHICH DIRECTION — code→spec (extract fields from code) or spec→code (edit source to match spec). Confirm the direction if the ask is ambiguous."
      },
      {
        "id": "14515e11-7c51-488c-9eff-4ae9b1e66a6e",
        "text": "CODE → SPEC: \"{PEBBLES_CLI}\" map-symbol <ModelName> --kind class to find the model file, read it, COUNT the columns first, then \"{PEBBLES_CLI}\" update <pebble> --patch with a fields object — every field with a description (its purpose) + status implemented, required=NOT NULL and defaults verbatim, refKey for FKs whose target exists — and link-code the model file. Reconcile counts (table has N, pebble shows N) before finishing."
      },
      {
        "id": "01f3877d-7060-4d5b-b30d-83b6c2a44cb8",
        "text": "SPEC → CODE: `get` the pebble, then edit the actual SOURCE files (never the .pebble) so the code matches the spec — migrations/models the way the codebase does it."
      },
      {
        "id": "b3fb4b45-c619-4bf9-9764-b2e918d532a6",
        "text": "Report: the diff between spec and code and which side you changed."
      }
    ],
    "verify": [
      {
        "id": "297afd64-2c3c-479d-861e-28f704b7101b",
        "text": "The spec and code now agree — state the remaining diff if any"
      }
    ],
    "whenToUse": "Reconciling a model pebble with the real code in either direction: code→spec extracts the fields; spec→code edits the source."
  },
  "createdAt": "2026-07-21T14:32:38.790Z",
  "description": "Fill a model pebble from the real code (or vice-versa)",
  "id": "5b435a22-7af1-4397-a1cb-752f9371d6f8",
  "name": "pebbles-sync-model",
